he school. On Sundays, the family has lunch together.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When do they have lunch together?","options":["On Sundays","On Mondays","On Fridays"],"answer":0,"explanation":"On Sundays Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many sisters does Leo have?","options":["Two","Three","One"],"answer":2,"explanation":"One Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is his sister called?","options":["Mia","Sara","Anna"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Sara Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"My parents ___ a pet cat.","answers":["have"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have with I, you, we and they. Use has with he, she and it. My parents have a pet cat."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Sara ___ a small family.","answers":["has"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have with I, you, we and they. Use has with he, she and it. Sara has a small family."},{"type":"text","prompt":"We do not ___ a dog.","answers":["have"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have with I, you, we and they. Use has with he, she and it. We do not have a dog."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Does Max ___ a brother?","answers":["have"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have with I, you, we and they. Use has with he, she and it. Does Max have a brother?"}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A1-2.2' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
