й».","answers":["small"],"hint":"s","explanation":"small — маленький."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «длинный».","answers":["long"],"hint":"l","explanation":"long — длинный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «короткий».","answers":["short"],"hint":"s","explanation":"short — короткий."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «быстрый».","answers":["fast"],"hint":"f","explanation":"fast — быстрый."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «медленный».","answers":["slow"],"hint":"s","explanation":"slow — медленный."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"The red bag is ___ than the blue one.","options":["light","lighter","lightest"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The red bag is lighter than the blue one."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"This is the ___ laptop in the shop.","options":["cheapest","cheaper","cheap"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the cheapest laptop in the shop."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"My new desk is ___ than my old one.","options":["biggest","big","bigger"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. My new desk is bigger than my old one."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Model B has a ___ battery than Model A.","options":["good","better","best"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. Model B has a better battery than Model A."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"This is the ___ interesting book in the library.","options":["most","more","much"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the most interesting book in the library."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The train is faster ___ the bus.","options":["then","that","than"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The train is faster than the bus."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["bag","is","lighter","than","the","blue","one","The","red"],"answers":["The red bag is lighter than the blue one."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["cheapest","laptop","in","the","shop","This","is","the"],"answers":["This is the cheapest laptop in the shop."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["bigger","than","my","old","one","My","new","desk","is"],"answers":["My new desk is bigger than my old one."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["battery","than","Model","A","Model","B","has","a","better"],"answers":["Model B has a better battery than Model A."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"I have two bags. The blue bag is bigger than the red bag. The red bag is lighter and cheaper. I use the red bag for school. My sister likes the blue one because it has more space. Both bags are new.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many bags does the writer have?","options":["Four","Two","Three"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Two Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag is bigger?","options":["The blue bag","The red bag","Both are the same size."],"answer":0,"explanation":"The blue bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag is lighter?","options":["The blue bag","The text does not say.","The red bag"],"answer":2,"explanation":"The red bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-13b286dee21d.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"I have two bags. The blue bag is bigger than the red bag. The red bag is lighter and cheaper. I use the red bag for school. My sister likes the blue one because it has more space. Both bags are new.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag is cheaper?","options":["Both cost the same.","The red bag","The blue bag"],"answer":1,"explanation":"The red bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag does the writer use for school?","options":["The red bag","The blue bag","Neither bag"],"answer":0,"explanation":"The red bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Why does the sister like the blue bag?","options":["It is cheaper.","It is older.","It has more space."],"answer":2,"explanation":"It has more space. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the 