лово или выражение: «плохой».","answers":["bad"],"hint":"b","explanation":"bad — плохой."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «лучше».","answers":["better"],"hint":"b","explanation":"better — лучше."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «лучший».","answers":["best"],"hint":"b","explanation":"best — лучший."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «любимый».","answers":["favourite"],"hint":"f","explanation":"favourite — любимый."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «выбирать».","answers":["choose"],"hint":"c","explanation":"choose — выбирать."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"This is the ___ interesting book in the library.","options":["more","much","most"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the most interesting book in the library."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The train is faster ___ the bus.","options":["that","than","then"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The train is faster than the bus."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The red bag is ___ than the blue one.","options":["lighter","lightest","light"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The red bag is lighter than the blue one."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"This is the ___ laptop in the shop.","options":["cheaper","cheap","cheapest"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the cheapest laptop in the shop."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"My new desk is ___ than my old one.","options":["big","bigger","biggest"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. My new desk is bigger than my old one."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Model B has a ___ battery than Model A.","options":["better","best","good"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. Model B has a better battery than Model A."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["the","most","interesting","book","in","the","library","This","is"],"answers":["This is the most interesting book in the library."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["faster","than","the","bus","The","train","is"],"answers":["The train is faster than the bus."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["lighter","than","the","blue","one","The","red","bag","is"],"answers":["The red bag is lighter than the blue one."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["in","the","shop","This","is","the","cheapest","laptop"],"answers":["This is the cheapest laptop in the shop."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"I have two bags. The blue bag is bigger than the red bag. The red bag is lighter and cheaper. I use the red bag for school. My sister likes the blue one because it has more space. Both bags are new.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag does the writer use for school?","options":["The blue bag","Neither bag","The red bag"],"answer":2,"explanation":"The red bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Why does the sister like the blue bag?","options":["It is older.","It has more space.","It is cheaper."],"answer":1,"explanation":"It has more space. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many bags does the writer have?","options":["Two","Three","Four"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Two Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-13b286dee21d.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"I have two bags. The blue bag is bigger than the red bag. The red bag is lighter and cheaper. I use the red bag for school. My sister likes the blue one because it has more space. Both bags are new.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag is bigger?","options":["The red bag","Both are the same size.","The blue bag"],"answer":2,"explanation":"The blue bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag is lighter?","options":["The text does not say.","The red bag","The blue bag"],"answer":1,"explanation":"The red bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which bag is cheaper?","options":["The red bag","The blue bag","Both cost the same."],"answer":0,"explanation":"The red bag Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"This is the ___ interesting book in the library.","answers":["most"],"hint":"m","explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the most interesting book in the library."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The train is faster ___ the bus.","answers":["than"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The train is faster than the bus."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The red bag is ___ than the blue one.","answers":["lighter"],"hint":"l","explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The red bag is lighter than the blue one."},{"type":"text","prompt":"This is the ___ laptop in the shop.","answers":["cheapest"],"hint":"c","explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the cheapest laptop in the shop."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A1-10.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
