заранее"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: prepare — готовить заранее","word":"prepare"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/A1-11-1-f3da29f81f8d.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"be going to","instructions":"What comes next / Words & forms.\nUse am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking.\n\nRosa is going to have a picnic.\nWe are going to invite six friends.\nI am going to bring juice.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. What comes next. Our focus is be going to. Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. Listen to these examples. Rosa is going to have a picnic. We are going to invite six friends. I am going to bring juice. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Reported speech","be going to","Present Perfect"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["Rosa is going to have a picnic.","Rosa are going to have a picnic.","Rosa am going to have a picnic."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/A1-11-1-f3da29f81f8d.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «завтра».","answers":["tomorrow"],"hint":"t","explanation":"tomorrow — завтра."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «на следующей неделе».","answers":["next week"],"hint":"n","explanation":"next week — на следующей неделе."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «план».","answers":["plan"],"hint":"p","explanation":"plan — план."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «будущее».","answers":["future"],"hint":"f","explanation":"future — будущее."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «вечеринка».","answers":["party"],"hint":"p","explanation":"party — вечеринка."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «пикник».","answers":["picnic"],"hint":"p","explanation":"picnic — пикник."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Rosa ___ going to have a picnic.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. Rosa is going to have a picnic."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We are going to ___ six friends.","options":["invites","inviting","invite"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. We are going to invite six friends."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I ___ going to bring juice.","options":["are","am","is"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. I am going to bring juice."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ they going to meet at eleven?","options":["Are","Do","Does"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. Are they going to meet at eleven?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Her brother is not going to ___ tea.","options":["makes","making","make"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. Her brother is not going to make tea."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What are you going to ___ tomorrow?","options":["doing","do","does"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. What are you going to do tomorrow?"}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["going","to","have","a","picnic","Rosa","is"],"answers":["Rosa is going to have a picnic."],"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["to","invite","six","friends","We","are","going"],"answers":["We are going to invite six friends."],"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["bring","juice","I","am","going","to"],"answers":["I am going to bring juice."],"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["at","eleven","Are","they","going","to","meet"],"answers":["Are they going to meet at eleven?"],"explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Next Saturday, Rosa is going to have a picnic. She is going to invite six friends. Her brother is going to make sandwiches. Rosa is going to bring juice. They are going to meet in the park at eleven. If it rains, they can stay at her house.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When is the picnic?","options":["Next Saturday","Tomorrow morning","Next Monday"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Next Saturday Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many friends is Rosa going to invite?","options":["Four","Ten","Six"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Six Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who is going to make sandwiches?","options":["Rosa’s teacher","Her brother","Her mother"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Her brother Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-7172bcf41269.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Next Saturday, Rosa is going to have a picnic. She is going to invite six friends. Her brother is going to make sandwiches. Rosa is going to bring juice. They are going to meet in the park at eleven. If it rains, they can stay at her house.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is Rosa going to bring?","options":["Juice","Soup","Coffee"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Juice Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"When are they going to meet?","options":["At eight","At two","At eleven"],"answer":2,"explanation":"At eleven Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where can they stay if it rains?","options":["At a hotel","At Rosa’s house","At school"],"answer":1,"explanation":"At Rosa’s house Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Rosa ___ going to have a picnic.","answers":["is"],"hint":"i","explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. Rosa is going to have a picnic."},{"type":"text","prompt":"We are going to ___ six friends.","answers":["invite"],"hint":"i","explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. We are going to invite six friends."},{"type":"text","prompt":"I ___ going to bring juice.","answers":["am"],"hint":"a","explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. I am going to bring juice."},{"type":"text","prompt":"___ they going to meet at eleven?","answers":["Are"],"hint":"A","explanation":"Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking. Are they going to meet at eleven?"}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A1-11.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
