ажение: «после».","answers":["after"],"hint":"a","explanation":"after — после."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «с кем-то».","answers":["with"],"hint":"w","explanation":"with — с кем-то."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «без».","answers":["without"],"hint":"w","explanation":"without — без."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «другой или отличающийся».","answers":["different"],"hint":"d","explanation":"different — другой или отличающийся."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «такой же».","answers":["same"],"hint":"s","explanation":"same — такой же."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ days does she study? Monday and Wednesday.","options":["Which","Who","Whose"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. Which days does she study? Monday and Wednesday."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ is your teacher? Anna.","options":["Where","When","Who"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. Who is your teacher? Anna."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ do classes start? At six.","options":["Who","When","Where"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. When do classes start? At six."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ do you practise? For twenty minutes.","options":["How long","How many","Who"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. How long do you practise? For twenty minutes."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ does Maya study? At Orbit.","options":["Who","Whose","Where"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. Where does Maya study? At Orbit."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ she like listening tasks?","options":["Is","Does","Do"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. Does she like listening tasks?"}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["does","she","study?","Monday","and","Wednesday","Which","days"],"answers":["Which days does she study? Monday and Wednesday."],"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["teacher?","Anna","Who","is","your"],"answers":["Who is your teacher? Anna."],"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["At","six","When","do","classes","start?"],"answers":["When do classes start? At six."],"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["For","twenty","minutes","How","long","do","you","practise?"],"answers":["How long do you practise? For twenty minutes."],"explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"A new student asks Maya about Orbit. Classes start at six in the evening. Maya studies on Monday and Wednesday. She practises English for twenty minutes every day. She likes listening tasks. Her next goal is to read a short book in English.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which tasks does she like?","options":["Listening tasks","Only writing tasks","Only grammar tasks"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Listening tasks Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is her next goal?","options":["Move to London","Become a teacher","Read a short English book"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Read a short English book Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who asks Maya about Orbit?","options":["A shop assistant","A new student","Her doctor"],"answer":1,"explanation":"A new student Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-33e75b790ef8.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"A new student asks Maya about Orbit. Classes start at six in the evening. Maya studies on Monday and Wednesday. She practises English for twenty minutes every day. She likes listening tasks. Her next goal is to read a short book in English.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When do classes start?","options":["At six in the evening","At six in the morning","At nine in the morning"],"answer":0,"explanation":"At six in the evening Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Which days does Maya study?","options":["Tuesday and Friday","Saturday and Sunday","Monday and Wednesday"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Monday and Wednesday Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How long does she practise every day?","options":["Five minutes","Twenty minutes","Two hours"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Twenty minutes Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"___ days does she study? Monday and Wednesday.","answers":["Which"],"hint":"W","explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. Which days does she study? Monday and Wednesday."},{"type":"text","prompt":"___ is your teacher? Anna.","answers":["Who"],"hint":"W","explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. Who is your teacher? Anna."},{"type":"text","prompt":"___ do classes start? At six.","answers":["When"],"hint":"W","explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. When do classes start? At six."},{"type":"text","prompt":"___ do you practise? For twenty minutes.","answers":["How long"],"hint":"H","explanation":"Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration. How long do you practise? For twenty minutes."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A1-12.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='New experiences · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"experience","meaning":"жизненный опыт"},{"word":"abroad","meaning":"за границей"},{"word":"journey","meaning":"путешествие"},{"word":"adventure","meaning":"приключение"},{"word":"discover","meaning":"открывать новое"},{"word":"explore","meaning":"исследовать"},{"word":"already","meaning":"уже"},{"word":"yet","meaning":"ещё в вопросах и отрицаниях"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: experience","options":["никогда","возвращаться","жизненный опыт"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: experience — жизненный опыт","word":"experience"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: abroad","options":["паспорт","за границей","недавно"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: abroad — за границей","word":"abroad"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: journey","options":["путешествие","раньше","багаж"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: journey — путешествие","word":"journey"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: adventure","options":["пробовать","гид","приключение"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: adventure — приключение","word":"adventure"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: discover","options":["экскурсия","открывать новое","пробовать на вкус"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: discover — открывать новое","word":"discover"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: explore","options":["исследовать","подниматься","воспоминание"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: explore — исследовать","word":"explore"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: already","options":["плыть под парусом","сувенир","уже"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: already — уже","word":"already"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: yet","options":["жизненный опыт","ещё в вопросах и отрицаниях","посещать"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: yet — ещё в вопросах и отрицаниях","word":"yet"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/A2-1-1-1f9e30543297.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Present Perfect","instructions":"New experiences / Words & forms.\nUse have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time.\n\nSara has visited three countries.\nHave you ever tried sailing?\nShe has not booked a hotel yet.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. New experiences. Our focus is Present Perfect. Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Listen to these examples. Sara has visited three countries. Have you ever tried sailing? She has not booked a hotel yet. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Reported speech","Present Perfect","am / is / are"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["Sara has visited three countries.","Sara has visit three countries.","Sara has visits three countries."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/A2-1-1-1f9e30543297.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «жизненный опыт».","answers":["experience"],"hint":"e","explanation":"experience — жизненный опыт."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «за границей».","answers":["abroad"],"hint":"a","explanation":"abroad — за границей."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «путешествие».","answers":["journey"],"hint":"j","explanation":"journey — путешествие."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «приключение».","answers":["adventure"],"hint":"a","explanation":"adventure — приключение."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «открывать новое».","answers":["discover"],"hint":"d","explanation":"discover — открывать новое."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «исследовать».","answers":["explore"],"hint":"e","explanation":"explore — исследовать."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Sara has ___ three countries.","options":["visit","visits","visited"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Sara has visited three countries."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Have you ___ tried sailing?","options":["since","ever","yet"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Have you ever tried sailing?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She has not booked a hotel ___.","options":["yet","already","ever"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She has not booked a hotel yet."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I ___ never climbed a mountain.","options":["has","am","have"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. I have never climbed a mountain."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She ___ to Italy last summer.","options":["go","went","has gone"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She went to Italy last summer."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"They have ___ bought a guidebook.","options":["already","yet","since"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. They have already bought a guidebook."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["visited","three","countries","Sara","has"],"answers":["Sara has visited three countries."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["tried","sailing","Have","you","ever"],"answers":["Have you ever tried sailing?"],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["a","hotel","yet","She","has","not","booked"],"answers":["She has not booked a hotel yet."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["mountain","I","have","never","climbed","a"],"answers":["I have never climbed a mountain."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Sara has visited three countries. She went to Italy last summer and tried sailing for the first time. She has never climbed a mountain. This year she wants to explore Georgia. She has already bought a guidebook, but she has not booked a hotel yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many countries has Sara visited?","options":["Two","Five","Three"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Three Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where did she go last summer?","options":["Spain","Italy","Georgia"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Italy Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did she try for the first time?","options":["Sailing","Climbing","Skiing"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Sailing Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-340c0ab88cfe.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Sara has visited three countries. She went to Italy last summer and tried sailing for the first time. She has never climbed a mountain. This year she wants to explore Georgia. She has already bought a guidebook, but she has not booked a hotel yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Has she climbed a mountain?","options":["Yes, many times.","Yes, last summer.","No, she has not."],"answer":2,"explanation":"No, she has not. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where does she want to go this year?","options":["Canada","Georgia","Italy"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Georgia Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has she already bought?","options":["A guidebook","A suitcase","A hotel room"],"answer":0,"explanation":"A guidebook Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Sara has ___ three countries.","answers":["visited"],"hint":"v","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Sara has visited three countries."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Have you ___ tried sailing?","answers":["ever"],"hint":"e","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Have you ever tried sailing?"},{"type":"text","prompt":"She has not booked a hotel ___.","answers":["yet"],"hint":"y","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She has not booked a hotel yet."},{"type":"text","prompt":"I ___ never climbed a mountain.","answers":["have"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. I have never climbed a mountain."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A2-1.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='New experiences · In context',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"ever","meaning":"когда-либо"},{"word":"never","meaning":"никогда"},{"word":"recently","meaning":"недавно"},{"word":"before","meaning":"раньше"},{"word":"try","meaning":"пробовать"},{"word":"taste","meaning":"пробовать на вкус"},{"word":"climb","meaning":"подниматься"},{"word":"sail","meaning":"плыть под парусом"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: ever","options":["за границей","когда-либо","возвращаться"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: ever — когда-либо","word":"ever"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: never","options":["никогда","паспорт","путешествие"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: never — никогда","word":"never"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: recently","options":["багаж","приключение","недавно"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: recently — недавно","word":"recently"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: before","options":["открывать новое","раньше","гид"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: before — раньше","word":"before"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: try","options":["пробовать","экскурсия","исследовать"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: try — пробовать","word":"try"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: taste","options":["воспоминание","уже","пробовать на вкус"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: taste — пробовать на вкус","word":"taste"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: climb","options":["ещё в вопросах и отрицаниях","подниматься","сувенир"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: climb — подниматься","word":"climb"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: sail","options":["плыть под парусом","жизненный опыт","когда-либо"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: sail — плыть под парусом","word":"sail"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/A2-1-2-59ceecd75e63.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Present Perfect","instructions":"New experiences / In context.\nUse have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time.\n\nShe has not booked a hotel yet.\nI have never climbed a mountain.\nShe went to Italy last summer.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. New experiences. Our focus is Present Perfect. Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Listen to these examples. She has not booked a hotel yet. I have never climbed a mountain. She went to Italy last summer. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Present Perfect","am / is / are","Reported speech"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["She has not booked a hotel already.","She has not booked a hotel ever.","She has not booked a hotel yet."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/A2-1-2-59ceecd75e63.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «когда-либо».","answers":["ever"],"hint":"e","explanation":"ever — когда-либо."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «никогда».","answers":["never"],"hint":"n","explanation":"never — никогда."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «недавно».","answers":["recently"],"hint":"r","explanation":"recently — недавно."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «раньше».","answers":["before"],"hint":"b","explanation":"before — раньше."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «пробовать».","answers":["try"],"hint":"t","explanation":"try — пробовать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «пробовать на вкус».","answers":["taste"],"hint":"t","explanation":"taste — пробовать на вкус."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"She has not booked a hotel ___.","options":["ever","yet","already"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She has not booked a hotel yet."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I ___ never climbed a mountain.","options":["have","has","am"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. I have never climbed a mountain."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She ___ to Italy last summer.","options":["has gone","go","went"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She went to Italy last summer."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"They have ___ bought a guidebook.","options":["since","already","yet"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. They have already bought a guidebook."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Sara has ___ three countries.","options":["visited","visit","visits"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Sara has visited three countries."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Have you ___ tried sailing?","options":["yet","since","ever"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. Have you ever tried sailing?"}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["not","booked","a","hotel","yet","She","has"],"answers":["She has not booked a hotel yet."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["climbed","a","mountain","I","have","never"],"answers":["I have never climbed a mountain."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["last","summer","She","went","to","Italy"],"answers":["She went to Italy last summer."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["guidebook","They","have","already","bought","a"],"answers":["They have already bought a guidebook."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Sara has visited three countries. She went to Italy last summer and tried sailing for the first time. She has never climbed a mountain. This year she wants to explore Georgia. She has already bought a guidebook, but she has not booked a hotel yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did she try for the first time?","options":["Skiing","Sailing","Climbing"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Sailing Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Has she climbed a mountain?","options":["No, she has not.","Yes, many times.","Yes, last summer."],"answer":0,"explanation":"No, she has not. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where does she want to go this year?","options":["Italy","Canada","Georgia"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Georgia Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-340c0ab88cfe.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Sara has visited three countries. She went to Italy last summer and tried sailing for the first time. She has never climbed a mountain. This year she wants to explore Georgia. She has already bought a guidebook, but she has not booked a hotel yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has she already bought?","options":["A hotel room","A guidebook","A suitcase"],"answer":1,"explanation":"A guidebook Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many countries has Sara visited?","options":["Three","Two","Five"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Three Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where did she go last summer?","options":["Georgia","Spain","Italy"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Italy Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"She has not booked a hotel ___.","answers":["yet"],"hint":"y","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She has not booked a hotel yet."},{"type":"text","prompt":"I ___ never climbed a mountain.","answers":["have"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. I have never climbed a mountain."},{"type":"text","prompt":"She ___ to Italy last summer.","answers":["went"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She went to Italy last summer."},{"type":"text","prompt":"They have ___ bought a guidebook.","answers":["already"],"hint":"a","explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. They have already bought a guidebook."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A2-1.2' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
