 time. Have you ever tried sailing?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She has not booked a hotel ___.","options":["already","ever","yet"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. She has not booked a hotel yet."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I ___ never climbed a mountain.","options":["am","have","has"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time. I have never climbed a mountain."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["to","Italy","last","summer","She","went"],"answers":["She went to Italy last summer."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["bought","a","guidebook","They","have","already"],"answers":["They have already bought a guidebook."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["countries","Sara","has","visited","three"],"answers":["Sara has visited three countries."],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["Have","you","ever","tried","sailing"],"answers":["Have you ever tried sailing?"],"explanation":"Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Sara has visited three countries. She went to Italy last summer and tried sailing for the first time. She has never climbed a mountain. This year she wants to explore Georgia. She has already bought a guidebook, but she has not booked a hotel yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where does she want to go this year?","options":["Georgia","Italy","Canada"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Georgia Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has she already bought?","options":["A suitcase","A hotel room","A guidebook"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A guidebook Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many countries has Sara visited?","options":["Five","Three","Two"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Three Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-340c0ab88cfe.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Sara has visited three countries. She went to Italy last summer and tried sailing for the first time. She has never climbed a mountain. This year she wants to explore Georgia. She has already bought a guidebook, but she has not booked a hotel yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where did she go last summer?","options":["Italy","Georgia","Spain"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Italy Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did she try for the first time?","options":["Climbing","Skiing","Sailing"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Sailing Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Has she climbed a mountain?","options":["Yes, last summer.","No, she has not.","Yes, many times."],"answer":1,"explanation":"No, she has not. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"pract