","prompt":"Выбери перевод: in the end","options":["осторожный","в итоге","сломаться о машине"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: in the end — в итоге","word":"in the end"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/A2-2-3-c27a41a7367a.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Past Continuous","instructions":"Stories in progress / Skills & review.\nUse was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it.\n\nWhat were you doing at eight yesterday?\nIt started to rain while we were walking.\nI was walking home when I heard a noise.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. Stories in progress. Our focus is Past Continuous. Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. Listen to these examples. What were you doing at eight yesterday? It started to rain while we were walking. I was walking home when I heard a noise. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["am / is / are","Reported speech","Past Continuous"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["What are you doing at eight yesterday?","What were you doing at eight yesterday?","What was you doing at eight yesterday?"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/A2-2-3-c27a41a7367a.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «осторожный».","answers":["careful"],"hint":"c","explanation":"careful — осторожный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «обеспокоенный».","answers":["worried"],"hint":"w","explanation":"worried — обеспокоенный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «искать».","answers":["look for"],"hint":"l","explanation":"look for — искать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «поднимать».","answers":["pick up"],"hint":"p","explanation":"pick up — поднимать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «оборачиваться».","answers":["turn around"],"hint":"t","explanation":"turn around — оборачиваться."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «убегать».","answers":["run away"],"hint":"r","explanation":"run away — убегать."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What ___ you doing at eight yesterday?","options":["was","are","were"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. What were you doing at eight yesterday?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"It started to rain while we were ___.","options":["walked","walking","walk"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. It started to rain while we were walking."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I ___ walking home when I heard a noise.","options":["was","were","am"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. I was walking home when I heard a noise."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The dog was ___ near a shop.","options":["stand","stood","standing"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. The dog was standing near a shop."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"While I ___ calling, the owner arrived.","options":["am","was","were"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. While I was calling, the owner arrived."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"They ___ waiting when the bus came.","options":["were","was","are"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. They were waiting when the bus came."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["you","doing","at","eight","yesterday","What","were"],"answers":["What were you doing at eight yesterday?"],"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["rain","while","we","were","walking","It","started","to"],"answers":["It started to rain while we were walking."],"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["when","I","heard","a","noise","I","was","walking","home"],"answers":["I was walking home when I heard a noise."],"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["a","shop","The","dog","was","standing","near"],"answers":["The dog was standing near a shop."],"explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"I was walking home when I heard a strange noise. A small dog was standing near a closed shop. It was wearing a red collar. While I was calling the number on the collar, its owner arrived. Luckily, the dog was safe. The owner thanked me.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who arrived while the writer was calling?","options":["A police officer","A teacher","The owner"],"answer":2,"explanation":"The owner Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Was the dog safe?","options":["The text does not say.","Yes, it was.","No, it was badly hurt."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Yes, it was. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What was the writer doing at the start?","options":["Walking home","Driving to work","Shopping for food"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Walking home Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-045d52133cd7.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"I was walking home when I heard a strange noise. A small dog was standing near a closed shop. It was wearing a red collar. While I was calling the number on the collar, its owner arrived. Luckily, the dog was safe. The owner thanked me.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did the writer hear?","options":["A phone alarm","A song","A strange noise"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A strange noise Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where was the dog?","options":["In a school","Near a closed shop","Inside a bus"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Near a closed shop Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What colour was its collar?","options":["Red","Blue","Black"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Red Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"What ___ you doing at eight yesterday?","answers":["were"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. What were you doing at eight yesterday?"},{"type":"text","prompt":"It started to rain while we were ___.","answers":["walking"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. It started to rain while we were walking."},{"type":"text","prompt":"I ___ walking home when I heard a noise.","answers":["was"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. I was walking home when I heard a noise."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The dog was ___ near a shop.","answers":["standing"],"hint":"s","explanation":"Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it. The dog was standing near a shop."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A2-2.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Plans and possibilities · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"arrange","meaning":"договариваться"},{"word":"appointment","meaning":"назначенная встреча"},{"word":"schedule","meaning":"расписание"},{"word":"available","meaning":"свободный по времени"},{"word":"cancel","meaning":"отменять"},{"word":"change","meaning":"изменять"},{"word":"decide","meaning":"решать"},{"word":"decision","meaning":"решение"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: arrange","options":["договариваться","вероятно","обратный билет"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: arrange — договариваться","word":"arrange"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: appointment","options":["возможно","задержка","назначенная встреча"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: appointment — назначенная встреча","word":"appointment"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: schedule","options":["вовремя","расписание","определённо"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: schedule — расписание","word":"schedule"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: available","options":["свободный по времени","бронировать","ждать с нетерпением"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: available — свободный по времени","word":"available"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: cancel","options":["бронь","готовиться к","отменять"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: cancel — отменять","word":"cancel"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: change","options":["отправляться в путь","изменять","отправление"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: change — изменять","word":"change"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: decide","options":["решать","прибытие","участвовать"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: decide — решать","word":"decide"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: decision","options":["платформа","договариваться","решение"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: decision — решение","word":"decision"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/A2-3-1-e4abd2397902.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Plans, arrangements and predictions","instructions":"Plans and possibilities / Words & forms.\nUse the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now.\n\nWe are visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked.\nI think the weather will be fine tomorrow.\nLook at those clouds. It is going to rain.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. Plans and possibilities. Our focus is Plans, arrangements and predictions. Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now. Listen to these examples. We are visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked. I think the weather will be fine tomorrow. Look at those clouds. It is going to rain. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Plans, arrangements and predictions","am / is / are","Reported speech"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["We is visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked.","We am visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked.","We are visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/A2-3-1-e4abd2397902.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «договариваться».","answers":["arrange"],"hint":"a","explanation":"arrange — договариваться."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «назначенная встреча».","answers":["appointment"],"hint":"a","explanation":"appointment — назначенная встреча."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «расписание».","answers":["schedule"],"hint":"s","explanation":"schedule — расписание."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «свободный по времени».","answers":["available"],"hint":"a","explanation":"available — свободный по времени."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «отменять».","answers":["cancel"],"hint":"c","explanation":"cancel — отменять."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «изменять».","answers":["change"],"hint":"c","explanation":"change — изменять."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"We ___ visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now. We are visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I think the weather ___ be fine tomorrow.","options":["is","has","will"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now. I think the weather will be fine tomorrow."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Look at those clouds. It is going to ___.","options":["raining","rain","rains"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now. Look at those clouds. It is going to rain."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The phone is ringing. I ___ answer it.","options":["will","am","have"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now. The phone is ringing. I will answer it."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We have bought tickets. We ___ flying on Monday.","options":["will","have","are"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now. We have bought tickets. We are flying on Monday."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I am going to ___ a packed lunch.","options":["taking","take","takes"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now. I am going to take a packed lunch."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["visiting","the","museum","on","Friday;","it","is","booked","We","are"],"answers":["We are visiting the museum on Friday; it is booked."],"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["weather","will","be","fine","tomorrow","I","think","the"],"answers":["I think the weather will be fine tomorrow."],"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["It","is","going","to","rain","Look","at","those","clouds."],"answers":["Look at those clouds. It is going to rain."],"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["will","answer","it","The","phone","is","ringing.","I"],"answers":["The phone is ringing. I will answer it."],"explanation":"Use the present continuous for a confirmed arrangement, going to for an intention, and will for a prediction or a decision made now."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Our class is visiting a science museum on Friday. We have booked a bus for nine o’clock. We are going to take packed lunches. The museum guide will meet us at the entrance. If the bus is late, our teacher will call the museum. We will probably return at four.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When is the class visiting the museum?","options":["On Friday","On Saturday","On Monday"],"answer":0,"explanation":"On Friday Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What time is the bus booked for?","options":["Ten o’clock","Noon","Nine o’clock"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Nine o’clock Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What food are they taking?","options":["No food","Packed lunches","Only fruit"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Packed lunches Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-74a8b6577009.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Our class is visiting a science museum on Friday. We have booked a bus for nine o’clock. We are going to take packed lunches. The museum guide will me