енный","скидка"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: modern — современный","word":"modern"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/A2-4-1-4cf3ba2a2986.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Comparatives and superlatives","instructions":"Better choices / Words & forms.\nUse a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group.\n\nThe red bag is lighter than the blue one.\nThis is the cheapest laptop in the shop.\nMy new desk is bigger than my old one.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. Better choices. Our focus is Comparatives and superlatives. Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. Listen to these examples. The red bag is lighter than the blue one. This is the cheapest laptop in the shop. My new desk is bigger than my old one. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Comparatives and superlatives","am / is / are","Reported speech"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["The red bag is lightest than the blue one.","The red bag is light than the blue one.","The red bag is lighter than the blue one."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/A2-4-1-4cf3ba2a2986.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «качество».","answers":["quality"],"hint":"q","explanation":"quality — качество."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «ценность».","answers":["value"],"hint":"v","explanation":"value — ценность."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «выбор».","answers":["choice"],"hint":"c","explanation":"choice — выбор."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «сравнивать».","answers":["compare"],"hint":"c","explanation":"compare — сравнивать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «покупатель».","answers":["customer"],"hint":"c","explanation":"customer — покупатель."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «отзыв».","answers":["review"],"hint":"r","explanation":"review — отзыв."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"The red bag is ___ than the blue one.","options":["lightest","light","lighter"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The red bag is lighter than the blue one."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"This is the ___ laptop in the shop.","options":["cheap","cheapest","cheaper"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the cheapest laptop in the shop."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"My new desk is ___ than my old one.","options":["bigger","biggest","big"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. My new desk is bigger than my old one."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Model B has a ___ battery than Model A.","options":["best","good","better"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. Model B has a better battery than Model A."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"This is the ___ interesting book in the library.","options":["much","most","more"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. This is the most interesting book in the library."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The train is faster ___ the bus.","options":["than","then","that"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group. The train is faster than the bus."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["bag","is","lighter","than","the","blue","one","The","red"],"answers":["The red bag is lighter than the blue one."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["cheapest","laptop","in","the","shop","This","is","the"],"answers":["This is the cheapest laptop in the shop."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["bigger","than","my","old","one","My","new","desk","is"],"answers":["My new desk is bigger than my old one."],"explanation":"Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["battery","than","Model","A","Model","B","has","a","better"],"answers":["Model B has a better battery than Model A