_ a uniform here.","options":["wear","wears","wearing"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. You do not have to wear a uniform here."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ I drink more water?","options":["Should to","Do should","Should"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. Should I drink more water?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She should ___ a doctor if the pain continues.","options":["seeing","see","sees"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. She should see a doctor if the pain continues."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["take","regular","breaks.","It","is","good","advice","You","should"],"answers":["You should take regular breaks. It is good advice."],"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["take","too","much","medicine","You","must","not"],"answers":["You must not take too much medicine."],"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["if","he","feels","worse","He","has","to","return"],"answers":["He has to return if he feels worse."],"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["wear","a","uniform","here","You","do","not","have","to"],"answers":["You d