taking","take","takes"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. You must not take too much medicine."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"He ___ to return if he feels worse.","options":["has","have","having"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. He has to return if he feels worse."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"You do not have to ___ a uniform here.","options":["wears","wearing","wear"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. You do not have to wear a uniform here."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["drink","more","water","Should","I"],"answers":["Should I drink more water?"],"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["a","doctor","if","the","pain","continues","She","should","see"],"answers":["She should see a doctor if the pain continues."],"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["breaks.","It","is","good","advice","You","should","take","regular"],"answers":["You should take regular breaks. It is good advice."],"explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["much","medicine","You","must","not","take","too"],"answers":["You must not take too much medicine."],"explanati