at should he drink more of?","options":["Coffee","Juice","Water"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Water Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"___ I drink more water?","answers":["Should"],"hint":"S","explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. Should I drink more water?"},{"type":"text","prompt":"She should ___ a doctor if the pain continues.","answers":["see"],"hint":"s","explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. She should see a doctor if the pain continues."},{"type":"text","prompt":"You ___ take regular breaks. It is good advice.","answers":["should"],"hint":"s","explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. You should take regular breaks. It is good advice."},{"type":"text","prompt":"You must not ___ too much medicine.","answers":["take"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary. You must not take too much medicine."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A2-6.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Learning and ambitions · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"goal","meaning":"цель"},{"word":"skill","meaning":"навык"},{"word":"progress","meaning":"прогресс"},{"word":"challenge","meaning":"сложная задача"},{"word":"succeed","meaning":"добиваться успеха"},{"word":"achieve","meaning":"достигать"},{"word":"fail","meaning":"терпеть неудачу"},{"word":"try again","meaning":"пробовать снова"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: goal","options":["суметь сделать","терпеливый","цель"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: goal — цель","word":"goal"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: skill","options":["мотивированный","навык","предлагать помощь"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: skill — навык","word":"skill"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: progress","options":["прогресс","соглашаться","любознательный"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: progress — прогресс","word":"progress"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: challenge","options":["наслаждаться","стремление","сложная задача"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: challenge — сложная задача","word":"challenge"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: succeed","options":["усилие","добиваться успеха","возражать против"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: succeed — добиваться успеха","word":"succeed"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: achieve","options":["достигать","предпочитать","возможность"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: achieve — достигать","word":"achieve"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: fail","options":["выбирать","улучшение","терпеть неудачу"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: fail — терпеть неудачу","word":"fail"},{"type":"choice",