,{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «навык».","answers":["skill"],"hint":"s","explanation":"skill — навык."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «прогресс».","answers":["progress"],"hint":"p","explanation":"progress — прогресс."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «сложная задача».","answers":["challenge"],"hint":"c","explanation":"challenge — сложная задача."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «добиваться успеха».","answers":["succeed"],"hint":"s","explanation":"succeed — добиваться успеха."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «достигать».","answers":["achieve"],"hint":"a","explanation":"achieve — достигать."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Zara enjoys ___ in her free time.","options":["to draw","draw","drawing"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Zara enjoys drawing in her free time."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She has decided ___ an online course.","options":["take","to take","taking"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. She has decided to take an online course."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Her friend offered ___ her.","options":["to help","helping","help"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Her friend offered to help her."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Do you mind ___ the window?","options":["to open","open","opening"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Do you mind opening the window?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She hopes ___ a poster next month.","options":["make","to make","making"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. She hopes to make a poster next month."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We managed ___ the work on time.","options":["to finish","finishing","finish"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. We managed to finish the work on time."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["drawing","in","her","free","time","Zara","enjoys"],"answers":["Zara enjoys drawing in her free time."],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["to","take","an","online","course","She","has","decided"],"answers":["She has decided to take an online course."],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["help","her","Her","friend","offered","to"],"answers":["Her friend offered to help her."],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["window","Do","you","mind","opening","the"],"answers":["Do you mind opening the window?"],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Zara wants to become a designer. She enjoys drawing and has decided to take an online course. At first, she found the software difficult. Her friend offered to help. Zara practises every evening. She hopes to make her first poster next month.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What does Zara want to become?","options":["A nurse","A pilot","A designer"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A designer Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What does she enjoy?","options":["Running","Drawing","Sailing"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Drawing Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What course has she decided to take?","options":["An online course","A cooking course","A driving course"],"answer":0,"explanation":"An online course Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-9102b8f7965b.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Zara wants to become a designer. She enjoys drawing and has decided to take an online course. At first, she found the software difficult. Her friend offered to help. Zara practises every evening. She hopes to make her first poster next month.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What was difficult at first?","options":["The teacher’s name","The bus journey","The software"],"answer":2,"explanation":"The software Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who offered to help?","options":["Her manager","Her friend","Her doctor"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Her friend Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What does she hope to make next month?","options":["A poster","A film","A dress"],"answer":0,"explanation":"A poster Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Zara enjoys ___ in her free time.","answers":["drawing"],"hint":"d","explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Zara enjoys drawing in her free time."},{"type":"text","prompt":"She has decided ___ an online course.","answers":["to take"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. She has decided to take an online course."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Her friend offered ___ her.","answers":["to help"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Her friend offered to help her."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Do you mind ___ the window?","answers":["opening"],"hint":"o","explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Do you mind opening the window?"}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A2-7.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Learning and ambitions · In context',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"practise","meaning":"практиковаться"},{"word":"manage","meaning":"суметь сделать"},{"word":"offer","meaning":"предлагать помощь"},{"word":"agree","meaning":"соглашаться"},{"word":"enjoy","meaning":"наслаждаться"},{"word":"mind","meaning":"возражать против"},{"word":"prefer","meaning":"предпочитать"},{"word":"choose","meaning":"выбирать"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: practise","options":["навык","практиковаться","терпеливый"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: practise — практиковаться","word":"practise"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: manage","options":["суметь сделать","мотивированный","прогресс"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: manage — суметь сделать","word":"manage"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: offer","options":["любознательный","сложная задача","предлагать помощь"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: offer — предлагать помощь","word":"offer"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: agree","options":["добиваться успеха","соглашаться","стремление"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: agree — соглашаться","word":"agree"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: enjoy","options":["наслаждаться","усилие","достигать"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: enjoy — наслаждаться","word":"enjoy"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: mind","options":["возможность","терпеть неудачу","возражать против"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: mind — возражать против","word":"mind"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: prefer","options":["пробовать снова","предпочитать","улучшение"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: prefer — предпочитать","w