."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «суметь сделать».","answers":["manage"],"hint":"m","explanation":"manage — суметь сделать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «предлагать помощь».","answers":["offer"],"hint":"o","explanation":"offer — предлагать помощь."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «соглашаться».","answers":["agree"],"hint":"a","explanation":"agree — соглашаться."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «наслаждаться».","answers":["enjoy"],"hint":"e","explanation":"enjoy — наслаждаться."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «возражать против».","answers":["mind"],"hint":"m","explanation":"mind — возражать против."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Her friend offered ___ her.","options":["help","to help","helping"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Her friend offered to help her."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Do you mind ___ the window?","options":["opening","to open","open"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Do you mind opening the window?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She hopes ___ a poster next month.","options":["making","make","to make"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. She hopes to make a poster next month."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We managed ___ the work on time.","options":["finish","to finish","finishing"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. We managed to finish the work on time."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Zara enjoys ___ in her free time.","options":["drawing","to draw","draw"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. Zara enjoys drawing in her free time."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She has decided ___ an online course.","options":["taking","take","to take"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage. She has decided to take an online course."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["offered","to","help","her","Her","friend"],"answers":["Her friend offered to help her."],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["opening","the","window","Do","you","mind"],"answers":["Do you mind opening the window?"],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["a","poster","next","month","She","hopes","to","make"],"answers":["She hopes to make a poster next month."],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["work","on","time","We","managed","to","finish","the"],"answers":["We managed to finish the work on time."],"explanation":"Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","ins