ons":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"This is the project ___ we started last year.","answers":["which"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use who for people, which for things and where for places in defining relative clauses. This is the project which we started last year."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The person ___ ideas we discussed is our mentor.","answers":["whose"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use who for people, which for things and where for places in defining relative clauses. The person whose ideas we discussed is our mentor."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Lina is the volunteer ___ teaches art.","answers":["who"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use who for people, which for things and where for places in defining relative clauses. Lina is the volunteer who teaches art."},{"type":"text","prompt":"This is the room ___ visitors study.","answers":["where"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use who for people, which for things and where for places in defining relative clauses. This is the room where visitors study."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='A2-8.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='If things change · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"condition","meaning":"условие"},{"word":"result","meaning":"результат"},{"word":"chance","meaning":"шанс"},{"word":"risk","meaning":"риск"},{"word":"unless","meaning":"если не"},{"word":"as soon as","meaning":"как только"},{"word":"if","meaning":"если"},{"word":"when","meaning":"когда"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: condition","options":["условие","тратить впустую","выключать"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: condition — условие","word":"condition"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: result","options":["перерабатывать","собирать мусор","результат"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: result — результат","word":"result"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: chance","options":["принимать меры","шанс","использовать повторно"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: chance — шанс","word":"chance"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: risk","options":["риск","окружающая среда","менять к лучшему"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: risk — риск","word":"risk"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: unless","options":["пластик","заботиться","если не"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: unless — если не","word":"unless"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: as soon as","options":["ответственный","как только","загрязнение"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: as soon as — как только","word":"as soon as"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: if","options":["если","дорожное движение","решение"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: if — если","word":"if"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: when","options":["экономить энергию","условие","когда"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: when — когда","word":"when"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/A2-9-1-ba370f1e221f.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"First Conditional","instructions":"If things change / Words & forms.\nUse if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility.\n\nIf the weather is good, we will meet at nine.\nIf it rains, we will go on Sunday.\nWe will leave when the park is clean.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. If things change. Our focus is First Conditional. Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility. Listen to these examples. If the weather is good, we will meet at nine. If it rains, we will go on Sunday. We will leave when the park is clean. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Reported speech","First Conditional","am / is / are"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["If the weather is good, we will meet at nine.","If the weather will be good, we will meet at nine.","If the weather was good, we will meet at nine."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/A2-9-1-ba370f1e221f.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «условие».","answers":["condition"],"hint":"c","explanation":"condition — условие."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «результат».","answers":["result"],"hint":"r","explanation":"result — результат."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «шанс».","answers":["chance"],"hint":"c","explanation":"chance — шанс."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «риск».","answers":["risk"],"hint":"r","explanation":"risk — риск."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «если не».","answers":["unless"],"hint":"u","explanation":"unless — если не."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «как только».","answers":["as soon as"],"hint":"a","explanation":"as soon as — как только."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"If the weather ___ good, we will meet at nine.","options":["is","will be","was"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility. If the weather is good, we will meet at nine."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"If it rains, we ___ go on Sunday.","options":["would","are","will"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility. If it rains, we will go on Sunday."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We will leave when the park ___ clean.","options":["was","is","will be"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility. We will leave when the park is clean."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"If everyone helps, we will ___ early.","options":["finish","finished","finishes"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility. If everyone helps, we will finish early."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"If you ___ water, you will have something to drink.","options":["will bring","brought","bring"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility. If you bring water, you will have something to drink."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We will not start unless the teacher ___.","options":["arrived","arrives","will arrive"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility. We will not start unless the teacher arrives."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["weather","is","good,","we","will","meet","at","nine","If","the"],"answers":["If the weather is good, we will meet at nine."],"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["we","will","go","on","Sunday","If","it","rains,"],"answers":["If it rains, we will go on Sunday."],"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["the","park","is","clean","We","will","leave","when"],"answers":["We will leave when the park is clean."],"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["finish","early","If","everyone","helps,","we","will"],"answers":["If everyone helps, we will finish early."],"explanation":"Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Our group is planning a park clean-up. If the weather is good, we will meet at nine. If i