 countries.","options":["is","are","does"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use am, is or are plus a past participle when the receiver of an action is the main focus. English is spoken in many countries."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"These chairs are ___ from wood.","options":["make","making","made"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use am, is or are plus a past participle when the receiver of an action is the main focus. These chairs are made from wood."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["are","made","from","recycled","cotton","The","bags"],"answers":["The bags are made from recycled cotton."],"explanation":"Use am, is or are plus a past participle when the receiver of an action is the main focus."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["checked","before","it","is","cut","The","fabric","is"],"answers":["The fabric is checked before it is cut."],"explanation":"Use am, is or are plus a past participle when the receiver of an action is the main focus."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["before","packing","Every","bag","is","tested"],"answers":["Every bag is tested before packing."],"explanation":"Use am, is or are plus a past participle when the receiver of an action is the main focus."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["local","shops","The","bags","are","delivered","to"],"answers":["The bags are delivered to local shops."],"explanation":"Use am, is or are plus a past participle when the receiver of an action is the main focus."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"At this small factory, bags are made from recycled cotton. First, the fabric is checked. Then it is cut and sewn by a team of twelve people. Every bag is tested before it is packed. The finished bags are delivered to local shops by electric van.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is made at the factory?","options":["Bags","Shoes","Chairs"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Bags Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What material is used?","options":["New plastic","Leather","Recycled cotton"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Recycled cotton Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What happens first?","options":["The van is repaired.","The fabric is checked.","The bags are sold."],"answer":1,"explanation":"The fabric is checked. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-9741dc1e0be1.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"At this small factory, bags are made from recycled cotton. First, the fabric is checked. Then it is cut and sewn by a team of twelve people. Every bag is tested before it is packed. The finished bags are delivered to local shops by electric van.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"How many people cut and sew?","options":["Twelve","Twenty","Six"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Twelve Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"When is each bag tested?","options":["After selling","Only once a year","Before packing"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Before packing Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How are bags delivered?","options":["By train","By electric van","By plane"],"answer":1,"explanation":"By electric van Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"The bags ___ made from recycled cotton.","answers":["are"],"hint":"a","explanation":"Use am, is or are plu