 или выражение: «происшествие».","answers":["incident"],"hint":"i","explanation":"incident — происшествие."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «обстоятельство».","answers":["circumstance"],"hint":"c","explanation":"circumstance — обстоятельство."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «раскрывать».","answers":["reveal"],"hint":"r","explanation":"reveal — раскрывать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «предполагать без проверки».","answers":["assume"],"hint":"a","explanation":"assume — предполагать без проверки."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «точный».","answers":["accurate"],"hint":"a","explanation":"accurate — точный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «вводящий в заблуждение».","answers":["misleading"],"hint":"m","explanation":"misleading — вводящий в заблуждение."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"They had not ___ the early post.","options":["saw","see","seen"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. They had not seen the early post."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ the manager confirmed the story before publication?","options":["Was","Had","Has"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. Had the manager confirmed the story before publication?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The passengers ___ left before the reporter arrived.","options":["had","have","were"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. The passengers had left before the reporter arrived."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The company had ___ replacement buses.","options":["arrange","arranging","arranged"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. The company had arranged replacement buses."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"By the time I got there, the meeting had ___.","options":["finishing","finished","finish"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. By the time I got there, the meeting had finished."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She checked the information after she ___ spoken to a witness.","options":["had","has","was"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. She checked the information after she had spoken to a witness."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["not","seen","the","early","post","They","had"],"answers":["They had not seen the early post."],"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["confirmed","the","story","before","publication","Had","the","manager"],"answers":["Had the manager confirmed the story before publication?"],"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["before","the","reporter","arrived","The","passengers","had","left"],"answers":["The passengers had left before the reporter arrived."],"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["buses","The","company","had","arranged","replacement"],"answers":["The company had arranged replacement buses."],"explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"By the time the reporter reached the station, the delayed passengers had left. A witness explained that the company had arranged replacement buses. The reporter checked the information with the station manager before publishing the story. An early social-media post had incorrectly claimed that no help was available.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When did the reporter publish?","options":["Before arriving","Before speaking to anyone","After checking the information"],"answer":2,"explanation":"After checking the information Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What was wrong with the early post?","options":["It described the reporter’s clothes.","It said no help was available.","It gave the correct bus times."],"answer":1,"explanation":"It said no help was available. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Had the passengers left before the reporter arrived?","options":["Yes, they had.","No, they were all waiting.","The station was closed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Yes, they had. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-369ef24d1a68.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"By the time the reporter reached the station, the delayed passengers had left. A witness explained that the company had arranged replacement buses. The reporter checked the information with the station manager before publishing the story. An early social-media post had incorrectly claimed that no help was available.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who explained what had happened?","options":["The reporter’s brother","A tourist guide","A witness"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A witness Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What had the company arranged?","options":["Hotel rooms","Replacement buses","Free flights"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Replacement buses Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who confirmed the information?","options":["The station manager","An anonymous caller","A shop assistant"],"answer":0,"explanation":"The station manager Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"They had not ___ the early post.","answers":["seen"],"hint":"s","explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. They had not seen the early post."},{"type":"text","prompt":"___ the manager confirmed the story before publication?","answers":["Had"],"hint":"H","explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. Had the manager confirmed the story before publication?"},{"type":"text","prompt":"The passengers ___ left before the reporter arrived.","answers":["had"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. The passengers had left before the reporter arrived."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The company had ___ replacement buses.","answers":["arranged"],"hint":"a","explanation":"Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event. The company had arranged replacement buses."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-2.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Choices and consequences · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"consequence","meaning":"последствие"},{"word":"alternative","meaning":"альтернатива"},{"word":"priority","meaning":"приоритет"},{"word":"compromise","meaning":"компромисс"},{"word":"opportunity","meaning":"возможность"},{"word":"obstacle","meaning":"препятствие"},{"word":"benefit","meaning":"преимущество или польза"},{"word":"drawback","meaning":"недостаток"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: consequence","options":["последствие","взвешивать варианты","маловероятный"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: consequence — последствие","word":"consequence"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: alternative","options":["позволить себе по средствам","разумный","альтернатива"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: alternative — альтернатива","word":"alternative"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: priority","options":["стоящий усилий","приоритет","колебаться"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: priority — приоритет","word":"priority"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: compromise","options":["компромисс","предполагать условно","брать ответственность"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: compromise — компромисс","word":"compromise"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: opportunity","options":["представлять","принять решение","возможность"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: opportunity — возможность","word":"opportunity"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: obstacle","options":["отклонять предложение","препятствие","иначе"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: obstacle — препятствие","word":"obstacle"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: benefit","optio