lary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «последствие».","answers":["consequence"],"hint":"c","explanation":"consequence — последствие."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «альтернатива».","answers":["alternative"],"hint":"a","explanation":"alternative — альтернатива."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «приоритет».","answers":["priority"],"hint":"p","explanation":"priority — приоритет."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «компромисс».","answers":["compromise"],"hint":"c","explanation":"compromise — компромисс."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «возможность».","answers":["opportunity"],"hint":"o","explanation":"opportunity — возможность."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «препятствие».","answers":["obstacle"],"hint":"o","explanation":"obstacle — препятствие."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"If Daniel accepted, he ___ live further away.","options":["would","will","is"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. If Daniel accepted, he would live further away."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"If I ___ more time, I would volunteer.","options":["have","will have","had"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. If I had more time, I would volunteer."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She would move if the rent ___ lower.","options":["is being","were","will be"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. She would move if the rent were lower."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"If you worked remotely, would you ___ the job?","options":["accept","accepted","accepting"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. If you worked remotely, would you accept the job?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I would not buy it if it ___ too expensive.","options":["will be","is being","were"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. I would not buy it if it were too expensive."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What ___ you do if you had a free year?","options":["are","would","will"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. What would you do if you had a free year?"}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["accepted,","he","would","live","further","away","If","Daniel"],"answers":["If Daniel accepted, he would live further away."],"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["more","time,","I","would","volunteer","If","I","had"],"answers":["If I had more time, I would volunteer."],"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["the","rent","were","lower","She","would","move","if"],"answers":["She would move if the rent were lower."],"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["you","accept","the","job","If","you","worked","remotely,","would"],"answers":["If you worked remotely, would you accept the job?"],"explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Daniel has been offered a job in another city. The salary is higher, but the rent would also be more expensive. If he accepted, he would live further from his family. He has decided to ask whether remote work is possible before making up his mind. His priority is a healthy work-life balance.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has Daniel been offered?","options":["A job in another city","A university place","A free apartment"],"answer":0,"explanation":"A job in another city Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is higher in the new job?","options":["The number of holidays","The train speed","The salary"],"answer":2,"explanation":"The salary Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What would be more expensive?","options":["His current bicycle","Rent","Food at his old office"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Rent Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-ae5f39bc353e.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Daniel has been offered a job in another city. The salary is higher, but the rent would also be more expensive. If he accepted, he would live further from his family. He has decided to ask whether remote work is possible before making up his mind. His priority is a healthy work-life balance.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What would happen if he accepted?","options":["He would live further from his family.","He would stop working.","He would have no salary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"He would live further from his family. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What will he ask about?","options":["A company car","Free meals","Remote work"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Remote work Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is his priority?","options":["The shortest interview","Work-life balance","The biggest office"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Work-life balance Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"If Daniel accepted, he ___ live further away.","answers":["would"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. If Daniel accepted, he would live further away."},{"type":"text","prompt":"If I ___ more time, I would volunteer.","answers":["had"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. If I had more time, I would volunteer."},{"type":"text","prompt":"She would move if the rent ___ lower.","answers":["were"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. She would move if the rent were lower."},{"type":"text","prompt":"If you worked remotely, would you ___ the job?","answers":["accept"],"hint":"a","explanation":"Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation. If you worked remotely, would you accept the job?"}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-3.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments