ие","запускать продукт"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: launch — запускать продукт","word":"launch"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: introduce","options":["инновация","внедрять","быть предназначенным для"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: introduce — внедрять","word":"introduce"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-4-1-bd027d3d5e8c.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Passive forms","instructions":"Changing the world / Words & forms.\nChoose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed.\n\nThe prototype was tested last year.\nA new filter has been developed by the team.\nThe device will be produced locally next year.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. Changing the world. Our focus is Passive forms. Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. Listen to these examples. The prototype was tested last year. A new filter has been developed by the team. The device will be produced locally next year. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["am / is / are","there is / there are","Passive forms"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["The prototype was testing last year.","The prototype was tested last year.","The prototype was test last year."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-4-1-bd027d3d5e8c.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «инновация».","answers":["innovation"],"hint":"i","explanation":"innovation — инновация."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «изобретение».","answers":["invention"],"hint":"i","explanation":"invention — изобретение."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «прорыв».","answers":["breakthrough"],"hint":"b","explanation":"breakthrough — прорыв."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «исследование».","answers":["research"],"hint":"r","explanation":"research — исследование."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «разработка».","answers":["development"],"hint":"d","explanation":"development — разработка."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «открытие».","answers":["discovery"],"hint":"d","explanation":"discovery — открытие."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"The prototype was ___ last year.","options":["test","testing","tested"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. The prototype was tested last year."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"A new filter has been ___ by the team.","options":["developing","developed","develop"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. A new filter has been developed by the team."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The device will be ___ locally next year.","options":["produced","produce","producing"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. The device will be produced locally next year."},{"typ