."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What helps clean the water?","options":["Paint","A special membrane","Salt"],"answer":1,"explanation":"A special membrane Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Why does the team want local production?","options":["To reduce costs","To make the device heavier","To stop testing"],"answer":0,"explanation":"To reduce costs Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"The prototype was ___ last year.","answers":["tested"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. The prototype was tested last year."},{"type":"text","prompt":"A new filter has been ___ by the team.","answers":["developed"],"hint":"d","explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. A new filter has been developed by the team."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The device will be ___ locally next year.","answers":["produced"],"hint":"p","explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. The device will be produced locally next year."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The system is ___ by sunlight.","answers":["powered"],"hint":"p","explanation":"Choose the tense of be, then use the past participle. The time expression tells you which tense is needed. The system is powered by sunlight."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-4.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
