UPDATE navigate_units SET title='What people said · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"announce","meaning":"объявлять"},{"word":"mention","meaning":"упоминать"},{"word":"explain","meaning":"объяснять"},{"word":"admit","meaning":"признавать"},{"word":"promise","meaning":"обещать"},{"word":"warn","meaning":"предупреждать"},{"word":"suggest","meaning":"предлагать идею"},{"word":"recommend","meaning":"рекомендовать"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: announce","options":["указывать на факт","объявлять","убеждать в истинности"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: announce — объявлять","word":"announce"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: mention","options":["упоминать","спорить или доказывать","поднимать тему"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: mention — упоминать","word":"mention"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: explain","options":["жаловаться","выяснять","объяснять"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: explain — объяснять","word":"explain"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: admit","options":["разъяснять","признавать","заявление"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: admit — признавать","word":"admit"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: promise","options":["обещать","просьба","связываться"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: promise — обещать","word":"promise"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: warn","options":["инструкция","недоразумение","предупреждать"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: warn — предупреждать","word":"warn"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: suggest","options":["уточнение","предлагать идею","разговор"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: suggest — предлагать идею","word":"suggest"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: recommend","options":["рекомендовать","согласно","объявлять"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: recommend — рекомендовать","word":"recommend"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-5-1-c130ab527543.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Reported speech","instructions":"What people said / Words & forms.\nWhen reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order.\n\nShe said the office would close early.\nLeo asked whether the team could work from home.\nShe explained that the building needed repairs.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. What people said. Our focus is Reported speech. When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. Listen to these examples. She said the office would close early. Leo asked whether the team could work from home. She explained that the building needed repairs. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["am / is / are","there is / there are","Reported speech"],"answer":2,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["She said the office is to be close early.","She said the office would close early.","She said the office will to close early."],"answer":1,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-5-1-c130ab527543.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «объявлять».","answers":["announce"],"hint":"a","explanation":"announce — объявлять."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «упоминать».","answers":["mention"],"hint":"m","explanation":"mention — упоминать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «объяснять».","answers":["explain"],"hint":"e","explanation":"explain — объяснять."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «признавать».","answers":["admit"],"hint":"a","explanation":"admit — признавать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «обещать».","answers":["promise"],"hint":"p","explanation":"promise — обещать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «предупреждать».","answers":["warn"],"hint":"w","explanation":"warn — предупреждать."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"She said the office ___ close early.","options":["is to be","would","will to"],"answer":1,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. She said the office would close early."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Leo asked whether the team ___ work from home.","options":["could","can to","was"],"answer":0,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. Leo asked whether the team could work from home."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She explained that the building ___ repairs.","options":["need","needing","needed"],"answer":2,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. She explained that the building needed repairs."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The manager reminded us ___ our files.","options":["save","to save","saving"],"answer":1,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. The manager reminded us to save our files."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"He asked where the meeting ___.","options":["was","was it","is it"],"answer":0,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. He asked where the meeting was."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She said she ___ sent a written summary.","options":["has been","was","had"],"answer":2,"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. She said she had sent a written summary."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["the","office","would","close","early","She","said"],"answers":["She said the office would close early."],"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["the","team","could","work","from","home","Leo","asked","whether"],"answers":["Leo asked whether the team could work from home."],"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["building","needed","repairs","She","explained","that","the"],"answers":["She explained that the building needed repairs."],"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["save","our","files","The","manager","reminded","us","to"],"answers":["The manager reminded us to save our files."],"explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"At Monday’s meeting, the manager said that the office would close early on Friday. She explained that the building needed repairs. Leo asked whether the team could work from home. The manager agreed and reminded everyone to save their files online. Later, she sent a written summary to avoid misunderstandings.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When was the meeting?","options":["On Sunday","On Monday","On Friday"],"answer":1,"explanation":"On Monday Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did the manager announce?","options":["The office would close early on Friday.","Everyone had lost their job.","A new office had opened."],"answer":0,"explanation":"The office would close early on Friday. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Why did the building need to close early?","options":["It was too small.","It had no furniture.","It needed repairs."],"answer":2,"explanation":"It needed repairs. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-a990a5664257.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"At Monday’s meeting, the manager said that the office would close early on Friday. She explained that the building needed repairs. Leo asked whether the team could work from home. The manager agreed and reminded everyone to save their files online. Later, she sent a written summary to avoid misunderstandings.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did Leo ask about?","options":["Changing his salary","Working from home","Taking a holiday"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Working from home Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Where should everyone save files?","options":["Online","Only on paper","On a shared USB stick"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Online Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Why did the manager send a summary?","options":["To advertise a product","To cancel the meeting","To avoid misunderstandings"],"answer":2,"explanation":"To avoid misunderstandings Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"She said the office ___ close early.","answers":["would"],"hint":"w","explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. She said the office would close early."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Leo asked whether the team ___ work from home.","answers":["could"],"hint":"c","explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. Leo asked whether the team could work from home."},{"type":"text","prompt":"She explained that the building ___ repairs.","answers":["needed"],"hint":"n","explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. She explained that the building needed repairs."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The manager reminded us ___ our files.","answers":["to save"],"hint":"t","explanation":"When reporting a past conversation, tenses often move back. Will becomes would, can becomes could, and a reported question uses statement word order. The manager reminded us to save our files."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-5.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
