ать связь"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: weakness — слабая сторона","word":"weakness"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: trust","options":["поддерживающий","воодушевлять","доверие"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: trust — доверие","word":"trust"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-7-3-0f314bdacfbf.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Defining and non-defining clauses","instructions":"The people who matter / Skills & review.\nUse commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession.\n\nThe studio, which opened last year, is growing.\nThe people who helped us were volunteers.\nMy mentor, who runs a studio, is very supportive.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. The people who matter. Our focus is Defining and non-defining clauses. Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. Listen to these examples. The studio, which opened last year, is growing. The people who helped us were volunteers. My mentor, who runs a studio, is very supportive. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["am / is / are","there is / there are","Defining and non-defining clauses"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["The studio, where opened last year, is growing.","The studio, which opened last year, is growing.","The studio, that opened last year, is growing."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-7-3-0f314bdacfbf.vtt"},{"med