"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. My mentor, who runs a studio, is very supportive."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The project ___ we finished won an award.","options":["that","who","where"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. The project that we finished won an award."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"This is the office ___ we meet every Friday.","options":["which person","who","where"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. This is the office where we meet every Friday."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"A colleague ___ ideas I admire has joined us.","options":["which","whose","who"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. A colleague whose ideas I admire has joined us."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["which","opened","last","year,","is","growing","The","studio,"],"answers":["The studio, which opened last year, is growing."],"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["helped","us","were","volunteers","The","people","who"],"answers":["The people who helped us were volunteers."],"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["a","studio,","is","very","supportive","My","mentor,","who","runs"],"answers":["My mentor, who runs a studio, is very supportive."],"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["won","an","award","The","project","that","we","finished"],"answers":["The project that we finished won an award."],"explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"My mentor, who runs a small design studio, has taught me to ask better questions. The project that we worked on last month won a local award. Her office is the place where our team meets every Friday. A colleague whose ideas I admire has recently joined us. We all value honest feedback.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who has recently joined?","options":["A colleague whose ideas the writer admires","A new school teacher","The writer’s cousin"],"answer":0,"explanation":"A colleague whose ideas the writer admires Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What does the team value?","options":["Longer meetings","More rules","Honest feedback"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Honest feedback Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What does the mentor run?","options":["A travel agency","A design studio","A restaurant"],"answer":1,"explanation":"A design studio Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-71c95e82103a.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"My mentor, who runs a small design studio, has taught me to ask better questions. The project that we worked on last month won a local award. Her office is the place where our team meets every Friday. A colleague whose ideas I admire has recently joined us. We all value honest feedback.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has the writer learned?","options":["To ask better questions","To drive a bus","To speak five languages"],"answer":0,"explanation":"To ask better questions Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What happened to last month’s project?","options":["It was cancelled.","It was lost.","It won a local award."],"answer":2,"explanation":"It won a local award. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"When does the team meet?","options":["Only once a year","Every Friday","Every Monday"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Every Friday Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"The studio, ___ opened last year, is growing.","answers":["which"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. The studio, which opened last year, is growing."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The people ___ helped us were volunteers.","answers":["who"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. The people who helped us were volunteers."},{"type":"text","prompt":"My mentor, ___ runs a studio, is very supportive.","answers":["who"],"hint":"w","explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. My mentor, who runs a studio, is very supportive."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The project ___ we finished won an award.","answers":["that"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession. The project that we finished won an award."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-7.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Things we have been doing · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"ongoing","meaning":"продолжающийся"},{"word":"temporary","meaning":"временный"},{"word":"permanent","meaning":"постоянный"},{"word":"recent","meaning":"недавний"},{"word":"gradually","meaning":"постепенно"},{"word":"steadily","meaning":"неуклонно"},{"word":"for a while","meaning":"некоторое время"},{"word":"lately","meaning":"в последнее время"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: ongoing","options":["продолжать несмотря ни на что","продолжающийся","с понедельника"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: ongoing — продолжающийся","word":"ongoing"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: temporary","options":["временный","за последний год","израсходовать запас"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: temporary — временный","word":"temporary"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: permanent","options":["до сих пор","наверстать","постоянный"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: permanent — постоянный","word":"permanent"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: recent","options":["измученный","недавний","сосредоточиваться"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: recent — недавний","word":"recent"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: gradually","options":["постепенно","повторять перед экзаменом","продуктивный"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: gradually — постепенно","word":"gradually"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: steadily","options":["исследовать","последовательный","неуклонно"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: steadily — неуклонно","word":"steadily"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: for a while","options":["требовательный к усилиям","некоторое время","тренироваться"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: for a while — некоторое время","word":"for a while"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: lately","options":["в последнее время","стараться","продолжающийся"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: lately — в последнее время","word":"lately"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-8-1-b6de7aa93b43.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Present Perfect Continuous","instructions":"Things we have been doing / Words & forms.\nUse have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results.\n\nWe have been preparing the festival for six weeks.\nAda has been designing posters all morning.\nI have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. Things we have been doing. Our focus is Present Perfect Continuous. Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. Listen to these examples. We have been preparing the festival for six weeks. Ada has been designing posters all morning. I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Present Perfect Continuous","am / is / are","there is / there are"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["We have been prepare the festival for six weeks.","We have been prepared the festival for six weeks.","We have been preparing the festival for six weeks."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-8-1-b6de7aa93b43.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «продолжающийся».","answers":["ongoing"],"hint":"o","explanation":"ongoing — продолжающийся."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «временный».","answers":["temporary"],"hint":"t","explanation":"temporary — временный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «постоянный».","answers":["permanent"],"hint":"p","explanation":"permanent — постоянный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «недавний».","answers":["recent"],"hint":"r","explanation":"recent — недавний."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «постепенно».","answers":["gradually"],"hint":"g","explanation":"gradually — постепенно."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «неуклонно».","answers":["steadily"],"hint":"s","explanation":"steadily — неуклонно."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"We have been ___ the festival for six weeks.","options":["prepared","preparing","prepare"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. We have been preparing the festival for six weeks."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Ada ___ been designing posters all morning.","options":["has","have","is"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. Ada has been designing posters all morning."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I have ___ three artists today; the calls are finished.","options":["been contact","contact","contacted"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How long ___ you been working on this?","options":["are","have","has"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. How long have you been working on this?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"More volunteers have been ___ us lately.","options":["joining","join","joined"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. More volunteers have been joining us lately."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She has been studying ___ Monday.","options":["for","ago","since"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. She has been studying since Monday."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["been","preparing","the","festival","for","six","weeks","We","have"],"answers":["We have been preparing the festival for six weeks."],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["designing","posters","all","morning","Ada","has","been"],"answers":["Ada has been designing posters all morning."],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["artists","today;","the","calls","are","finished","I","have","contacted","three"],"answers":["I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished."],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["working","on","this","How","long","have","you","been"],"answers":["How long have you been working on this?"],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"For the past six weeks, our team has been preparing a community festival. I have been contacting local artists, while Ada has been designing posters. We have already booked the main stage. The work has been demanding, but more volunteers have been joining us lately. The festival starts next Saturday.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"How long has the team been preparing?","options":["Two days","Six weeks","Six months"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Six weeks Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has the writer been doing?","options":["Contacting local artists","Building a stage alone","Selling tickets abroad"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Contacting local artists Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has Ada been doing?","options":["Teaching music","Driving buses","Designing posters"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Designing posters Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-37b1dcfedac7.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"For the past six weeks, our team has been preparing a community festival. I have been contacting local artists, while Ada has been designing posters. We have already booked the main stage. The work has been demanding, but more volunteers have been joining us lately. The festival starts next Saturday.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has already been booked?","options":["A television studio","The main stage","Every hotel room"],"answer":1,"explanation":"The main stage Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has been happening lately?","options":["More volunteers have been joining.","Everyone has left.","All plans have been cancelled."],"answer":0,"explanation":"More volunteers have been joining. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"When does the festival start?","options":["Tomorrow morning","Next month","Next Saturday"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Next Saturday Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"We have been ___ the festival for six weeks.","answers":["preparing"],"hint":"p","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. We have been preparing the festival for six weeks."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Ada ___ been designing posters all morning.","answers":["has"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. Ada has been designing posters all morning."},{"type":"text","prompt":"I have ___ three artists today; the calls are finished.","answers":["contacted"],"hint":"c","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished."},{"type":"text","prompt":"How long ___ you been working on this?","answers":["have"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. How long have you been working on this?"}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-8.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Things we have been doing · In context',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"all morning","meaning":"всё утро"},{"word":"since Monday","meaning":"с понедельника"},{"word":"over the past year","meaning":"за последний год"},{"word":"up to now","meaning":"до сих пор"},{"word":"concentrate","meaning":"сосредоточиваться"},{"word":"revise","meaning":"повторять перед экзаменом"},{"word":"research","meaning":"исследовать"},{"word":"train","meaning":"тренироваться"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: all morning","options":["всё утро","продолжать несмотря ни на что","временный"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: all morning — всё утро","word":"all morning"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: since Monday","options":["израсходовать запас","постоянный","с понедельника"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: since Monday — с понедельника","word":"since Monday"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: over the past year","options":["недавний","за последний год","наверстать"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: over the past year — за последний год","word":"over the past year"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: up to now","options":["до сих пор","измученный","постепенно"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: up to now — до сих пор","word":"up to now"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: concentrate","options":["продуктивный","неуклонно","сосредоточиваться"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: concentrate — сосредоточиваться","word":"concentrate"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: revise","options":["некоторое время","повторять перед экзаменом","последовательный"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: revise — повторять перед экзаменом","word":"revise"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: research","options":["исследовать","требовательный к усилиям","в последнее время"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: research — исследовать","word":"research"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: train","options":["продолжающийся","всё утро","тренироваться"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: train — тренироваться","word":"train"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-8-2-70bbbd83b0eb.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Present Perfect Continuous","instructions":"Things we have been doing / In context.\nUse have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results.\n\nI have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished.\nHow long have you been working on this?\nMore volunteers have been joining us lately.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. Things we have been doing. Our focus is Present Perfect Continuous. Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. Listen to these examples. I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished. How long have you been working on this? More volunteers have been joining us lately. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Present Perfect Continuous","am / is / are","there is / there are"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["I have been contact three artists today; the calls are finished.","I have contact three artists today; the calls are finished.","I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-8-2-70bbbd83b0eb.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «всё утро».","answers":["all morning"],"hint":"a","explanation":"all morning — всё утро."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «с понедельника».","answers":["since Monday"],"hint":"s","explanation":"since Monday — с понедельника."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «за последний год».","answers":["over the past year"],"hint":"o","explanation":"over the past year — за последний год."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «до сих пор».","answers":["up to now"],"hint":"u","explanation":"up to now — до сих пор."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «сосредоточиваться».","answers":["concentrate"],"hint":"c","explanation":"concentrate — сосредоточиваться."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «повторять перед экзаменом».","answers":["revise"],"hint":"r","explanation":"revise — повторять перед экзаменом."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"I have ___ three artists today; the calls are finished.","options":["contacted","been contact","contact"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How long ___ you been working on this?","options":["has","are","have"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. How long have you been working on this?"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"More volunteers have been ___ us lately.","options":["joined","joining","join"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. More volunteers have been joining us lately."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She has been studying ___ Monday.","options":["since","for","ago"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. She has been studying since Monday."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We have been ___ the festival for six weeks.","options":["prepare","prepared","preparing"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. We have been preparing the festival for six weeks."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Ada ___ been designing posters all morning.","options":["is","has","have"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. Ada has been designing posters all morning."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["contacted","three","artists","today;","the","calls","are","finished","I","have"],"answers":["I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished."],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["you","been","working","on","this","How","long","have"],"answers":["How long have you been working on this?"],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["joining","us","lately","More","volunteers","have","been"],"answers":["More volunteers have been joining us lately."],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["Monday","She","has","been","studying","since"],"answers":["She has been studying since Monday."],"explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"For the past six weeks, our team has been preparing a community festival. I have been contacting local artists, while Ada has been designing posters. We have already booked the main stage. The work has been demanding, but more volunteers have been joining us lately. The festival starts next Saturday.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has Ada been doing?","options":["Designing posters","Teaching music","Driving buses"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Designing posters Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has already been booked?","options":["Every hotel room","A television studio","The main stage"],"answer":2,"explanation":"The main stage Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has been happening lately?","options":["All plans have been cancelled.","More volunteers have been joining.","Everyone has left."],"answer":1,"explanation":"More volunteers have been joining. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-37b1dcfedac7.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"For the past six weeks, our team has been preparing a community festival. I have been contacting local artists, while Ada has been designing posters. We have already booked the main stage. The work has been demanding, but more volunteers have been joining us lately. The festival starts next Saturday.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When does the festival start?","options":["Next Saturday","Tomorrow morning","Next month"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Next Saturday Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How long has the team been preparing?","options":["Six months","Two days","Six weeks"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Six weeks Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What has the writer been doing?","options":["Selling tickets abroad","Contacting local artists","Building a stage alone"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Contacting local artists Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"I have ___ three artists today; the calls are finished.","answers":["contacted"],"hint":"c","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. I have contacted three artists today; the calls are finished."},{"type":"text","prompt":"How long ___ you been working on this?","answers":["have"],"hint":"h","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. How long have you been working on this?"},{"type":"text","prompt":"More volunteers have been ___ us lately.","answers":["joining"],"hint":"j","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. More volunteers have been joining us lately."},{"type":"text","prompt":"She has been studying ___ Monday.","answers":["since"],"hint":"s","explanation":"Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results. She has been studying since Monday."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-8.2' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
