ревод: be likely to","options":["скорее всего сделать","общественный транспорт","многообещающий"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: be likely to — скорее всего сделать","word":"be likely to"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: be about to","options":["городской","предсказание","собираться вот-вот сделать"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: be about to — собираться вот-вот сделать","word":"be about to"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-9-1-55ab090fd9f3.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Future forms in context","instructions":"The future we imagine / Words & forms.\nUse the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event.\n\nConstruction is due to start in March.\nThe city is going to build a new tram line.\nI think the tram will reduce traffic.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. The future we imagine. Our focus is Future forms in context. Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. Listen to these examples. Construction is due to start in March. The city is going to build a new tram line. I think the tram will reduce traffic. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["Future forms in context","am / is / are","there is / there are"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["Construction is due starting in March.","Construction is due start in March.","Construction is due to start in March."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-9-1-55ab090fd9f3.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «предсказание».","answers":["prediction"],"hint":"p","explanation":"prediction — предсказание."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «прогноз».","answers":["forecast"],"hint":"f","explanation":"forecast — прогноз."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «тенденция».","answers":["trend"],"hint":"t","explanation":"trend — тенденция."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «оценка приблизительного количества».","answers":["estimate"],"hint":"e","explanation":"estimate — оценка приблизительного количества."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «ожидание».","answers":["expectation"],"hint":"e","explanation":"expectation — ожидание."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «намерение».","answers":["intention"],"hint":"i","explanation":"intention — намерение."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Construction is due ___ in March.","options":["to start","starting","start"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. Construction is due to start in March."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The city is ___ to build a new tram line.","options":["will","about","going"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The city is going to build a new tram line."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I think the tram ___ reduce traffic.","options":["has","will","is"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. I think the tram will reduce traffic."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We ___ meeting the engineers tomorrow; it is arranged.","options":["are","will","have"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. We are meeting the engineers tomorrow; it is arranged."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The bus is about ___; hurry up.","options":["leaving","leave","to leave"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The bus is about to leave; hurry up."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The first section should ___ ready by winter.","options":["being","be","to be"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The first section should be ready by winter."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["due","to","start","in","March","Construction","is"],"answers":["Construction is due to start in March."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["going","to","build","a","new","tram","line","The","city","is"],"answers":["The city is going to build a new tram line."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["will","reduce","traffic","I","think","the","tram"],"answers":["I think the tram will reduce traffic."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["tomorrow;","it","is","arranged","We","are","meeting","the","engineers"],"answers":["We are meeting the engineers tomorrow; it is arranged."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"The city is planning a new tram line. Construction is due to start in March. By next winter, engineers expect the first section to be ready. While the work is taking place, buses will use a different route. The council believes the tram will reduce traffic, but ticket prices have not been decided yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is the city planning?","options":["A tram line","An airport terminal","A football stadium"],"answer":0,"explanation":"A tram line Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"When is construction due to start?","options":["Next winter","Tomorrow","In March"],"answer":2,"explanation":"In March Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"When is the first section expected to be ready?","options":["In ten years","By next winter","By next week"],"answer":1,"explanation":"By next winter Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-f88962c21b99.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"The city is planning a new tram line. Construction is due to start in March. By next winter, engineers expect the first secti