tions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. We are meeting the engineers tomorrow; it is arranged."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-9.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
