":"t","explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The bus is about to leave; hurry up."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The first section should ___ ready by winter.","answers":["be"],"hint":"b","explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The first section should be ready by winter."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-9.2' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
