венный транспорт","неопределённый","собираться вот-вот сделать"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: uncertain — неопределённый","word":"uncertain"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: promising","options":["многообещающий","быть запланированным на","городской"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: promising — многообещающий","word":"promising"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-9-3-308f6cdd6a64.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Future forms in context","instructions":"The future we imagine / Skills & review.\nUse the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event.\n\nThe bus is about to leave; hurry up.\nThe first section should be ready by winter.\nConstruction is due to start in March.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. The future we imagine. Our focus is Future forms in context. Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. Listen to these examples. The bus is about to leave; hurry up. The first section should be ready by winter. Construction is due to start in March. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["there is / there are","Future forms in context","am / is / are"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["The bus is about to leave; hurry up.","The bus is about leaving; hurry up.","The bus is about leave; hurry up."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-9-3-308f6cdd6a64.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «городской».","answers":["urban"],"hint":"u","explanation":"urban — городской."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «сельский».","answers":["rural"],"hint":"r","explanation":"rural — сельский."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «население».","answers":["population"],"hint":"p","explanation":"population — население."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «инфраструктура».","answers":["infrastructure"],"hint":"i","explanation":"infrastructure — инфраструктура."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «инвестиция».","answers":["investment"],"hint":"i","explanation":"investment — инвестиция."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «приспособление».","answers":["adaptation"],"hint":"a","explanation":"adaptation — приспособление."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"The bus is about ___; hurry up.","options":["leave","to leave","leaving"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The bus is about to leave; hurry up."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The first section should ___ ready by winter.","options":["be","to be","being"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The first section should be ready by winter."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Construction is due ___ in March.","options":["starting","start","to start"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. Construction is due to start in March."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The city is ___ to build a new tram line.","options":["about","going","will"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The city is going to build a new tram line."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"I think the tram ___ reduce traffic.","options":["will","is","has"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. I think the tram will reduce traffic."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"We ___ meeting the engineers tomorrow; it is arranged.","options":["will","have","are"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. We are meeting the engineers tomorrow; it is arranged."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["is","about","to","leave;","hurry","up","The","bus"],"answers":["The bus is about to leave; hurry up."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["should","be","ready","by","winter","The","first","section"],"answers":["The first section should be ready by winter."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["start","in","March","Construction","is","due","to"],"answers":["Construction is due to start in March."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["build","a","new","tram","line","The","city","is","going","to"],"answers":["The city is going to build a new tram line."],"explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"The city is planning a new tram line. Construction is due to start in March. By next winter, engineers expect the first section to be ready. While the work is taking place, buses will use a different route. The council believes the tram will reduce traffic, but ticket prices have not been decided yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What does the council expect the tram to reduce?","options":["Rainfall","Traffic","The number of schools"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Traffic Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Have ticket prices been decided?","options":["Not yet","Yes, last year","Yes, they will all be free."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Not yet Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What is the city planning?","options":["An airport terminal","A football stadium","A tram line"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A tram line Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-f88962c21b99.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"The city is planning a new tram line. Construction is due to start in March. By next winter, engineers expect the first section to be ready. While the work is taking place, buses will use a different route. The council believes the tram will reduce traffic, but ticket prices have not been decided yet.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"When is construction due to start?","options":["Tomorrow","In March","Next winter"],"answer":1,"explanation":"In March Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"When is the first section expected to be ready?","options":["By next winter","By next week","In ten years"],"answer":0,"explanation":"By next winter Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What will buses do during construction?","options":["Stop permanently","Become free everywhere","Use a different route"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use a different route Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"The bus is about ___; hurry up.","answers":["to leave"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The bus is about to leave; hurry up."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The first section should ___ ready by winter.","answers":["be"],"hint":"b","explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The first section should be ready by winter."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Construction is due ___ in March.","answers":["to start"],"hint":"t","explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. Construction is due to start in March."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The city is ___ to build a new tram line.","answers":["going"],"hint":"g","explanation":"Use the right future form for arrangements, intentions, predictions and schedules. Be due to describes a scheduled event. The city is going to build a new tram line."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-9.3' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Finding the right words · Words & forms',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"express","meaning":"выражать"},{"word":"emphasise","meaning":"подчёркивать"},{"word":"clarify","meaning":"уточнять"},{"word":"paraphrase","meaning":"передавать другими словами"},{"word":"summarise","meaning":"кратко излагать"},{"word":"interpret","meaning":"толковать"},{"word":"avoid","meaning":"избегать"},{"word":"postpone","meaning":"откладывать"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: express","options":["точка зрения","выражать","предлагать идею"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: express — выражать","word":"express"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: emphasise","options":["подчёркивать","суметь","взгляд на ситуацию"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: emphasise — подчёркивать","word":"emphasise"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: clarify","options":["отказываться","тон высказывания","уточнять"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: clarify — уточнять","word":"clarify"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: paraphrase","options":["вежливый","передавать другими словами","не забыть сделать"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: paraphrase — передавать другими словами","word":"paraphrase"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: summarise","options":["кратко излагать","помнить прошлое действие","прямой"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: summarise — кратко излагать","word":"summarise"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: interpret","options":["остановиться чтобы сделать","деликатный","толковать"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: interpret — толковать","word":"interpret"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: avoid","options":["уместный","избегать","прекратить действие"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: avoid — избегать","word":"avoid"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: postpone","options":["откладывать","довод","выражать"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: postpone — откладывать","word":"postpone"}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/B1-10-1-363a7a6beea6.mp4","type":"video","skill":"grammar","title":"Verb patterns and meaning","instructions":"Finding the right words / Words & forms.\nAn ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity.\n\nNoor decided to ask a colleague for feedback.\nThe colleague suggested making the opening shorter.\nShe remembered to attach the report before sending.","transcript":"Welcome to Orbit. Finding the right words. Our focus is Verb patterns and meaning. An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. Listen to these examples. Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback. The colleague suggested making the opening shorter. She remembered to attach the report before sending. Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now practise the vocabulary and complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Что отрабатываем в этом видео?","options":["am / is / are","there is / there are","Verb patterns and meaning"],"answer":2,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери предложение из объяснения.","options":["Noor decided ask a colleague for feedback.","Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback.","Noor decided asking a colleague for feedback."],"answer":1,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-10-1-363a7a6beea6.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «выражать».","answers":["express"],"hint":"e","explanation":"express — выражать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «подчёркивать».","answers":["emphasise"],"hint":"e","explanation":"emphasise — подчёркивать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «уточнять».","answers":["clarify"],"hint":"c","explanation":"clarify — уточнять."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «передавать другими словами».","answers":["paraphrase"],"hint":"p","explanation":"paraphrase — передавать другими словами."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «кратко излагать».","answers":["summarise"],"hint":"s","explanation":"summarise — кратко излагать."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «толковать».","answers":["interpret"],"hint":"i","explanation":"interpret — толковать."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Noor decided ___ a colleague for feedback.","options":["ask","to ask","asking"],"answer":1,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The colleague suggested ___ the opening shorter.","options":["making","to make","make"],"answer":0,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. The colleague suggested making the opening shorter."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"She remembered ___ the report before sending.","options":["attaching to","attach","to attach"],"answer":2,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. She remembered to attach the report before sending."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"He stopped ___ his phone so he could concentrate.","options":["check","checking","to checking"],"answer":1,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. He stopped checking his phone so he could concentrate."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"They managed ___ the problem clearly.","options":["to explain","explaining","explain"],"answer":0,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. They managed to explain the problem clearly."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Would you mind ___ this paragraph?","options":["to read","read","reading"],"answer":2,"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. Would you mind reading this paragraph?"}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["to","ask","a","colleague","for","feedback","Noor","decided"],"answers":["Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback."],"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["making","the","opening","shorter","The","colleague","suggested"],"answers":["The colleague suggested making the opening shorter."],"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["the","report","before","sending","She","remembered","to","attach"],"answers":["She remembered to attach the report before sending."],"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["so","he","could","concentrate","He","stopped","checking","his","phone"],"answers":["He stopped checking his phone so he could concentrate."],"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Before sending an important email, Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback. The colleague suggested making the opening shorter and avoiding an angry tone. Noor remembered to attach the report. After rewriting the message, she managed to explain the problem clearly without blaming anyone.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What was Noor preparing?","options":["An important email","A birthday cake","A travel video"],"answer":0,"explanation":"An important email Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who gave feedback?","options":["A customer at a café","A stranger online","A colleague"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A colleague Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did the colleague suggest?","options":["Using an angry tone","Making the opening shorter","Deleting every detail"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Making the opening shorter Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-e5f07500d0ed.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Before sending an important email, Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback. The colleague suggested making the opening shorter and avoiding an angry tone. Noor remembered to attach the report. After rewriting the message, she managed to explain the problem clearly without blaming anyone.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did Noor remember to do?","options":["Attach the report","Book a flight","Call a taxi"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Attach the report Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Did she rewrite the message?","options":["No, she refused.","The text does not say.","Yes, she did."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Yes, she did. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"How did the final message explain the problem?","options":["Only with pictures","Clearly without blaming anyone","Angrily without evidence"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Clearly without blaming anyone Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Noor decided ___ a colleague for feedback.","answers":["to ask"],"hint":"t","explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback."},{"type":"text","prompt":"The colleague suggested ___ the opening shorter.","answers":["making"],"hint":"m","explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. The colleague suggested making the opening shorter."},{"type":"text","prompt":"She remembered ___ the report before sending.","answers":["to attach"],"hint":"t","explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. She remembered to attach the report before sending."},{"type":"text","prompt":"He stopped ___ his phone so he could concentrate.","answers":["checking"],"hint":"c","explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. He stopped checking his phone so he could concentrate."}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-10.1' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
UPDATE navigate_units SET title='Finding the right words · In context',edition='ORBIT Original Practice · 2026',status='published',steps='[{"mediaUrl":"","type":"vocabulary","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Vocabulary","instructions":"Изучи слова: послушай произношение, проверь перевод, затем выполни проверку.","words":[{"word":"consider","meaning":"рассматривать возможность"},{"word":"suggest","meaning":"предлагать идею"},{"word":"manage","meaning":"суметь"},{"word":"refuse","meaning":"отказываться"},{"word":"remember to","meaning":"не забыть сделать"},{"word":"remember doing","meaning":"помнить прошлое действие"},{"word":"stop to","meaning":"остановиться чтобы сделать"},{"word":"stop doing","meaning":"прекратить действие"}],"questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: consider","options":["рассматривать возможность","точка зрения","подчёркивать"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: consider — рассматривать возможность","word":"consider"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: suggest","options":["взгляд на ситуацию","уточнять","предлагать идею"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: suggest — предлагать идею","word":"suggest"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: manage","options":["передавать другими словами","суметь","тон высказывания"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: manage — суметь","word":"manage"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: refuse","options":["отказываться","вежливый","кратко излагать"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: refuse — отказываться","word":"refuse"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: remember to","options":["прямой","толковать","не забыть сделать"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: remember to — не забыть сделать","word":"remember to"},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Выбери перевод: remember doing","options":["избегать","помнить прошлое действие","деликатный"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Выбери перевод: remember doing — помнить прошлое действие","word":"remember doing"},{"type":