ng means to end an activity."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["his","phone","so","he","could","concentrate","He","stopped","checking"],"answers":["He stopped checking his phone so he could concentrate."],"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["the","problem","clearly","They","managed","to","explain"],"answers":["They managed to explain the problem clearly."],"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["paragraph","Would","you","mind","reading","this"],"answers":["Would you mind reading this paragraph?"],"explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Before sending an important email, Noor decided to ask a colleague for feedback. The colleague suggested making the opening shorter and avoiding an angry tone. Noor remembered to attach the report. After rewriting the message, she managed to explain the problem clearly without blaming anyone.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did the colleague suggest?","options":["Deleting every detail","Using an angry tone","Making the opening shorter"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Making the opening shorter Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What did Noor remember to do?","options":["Call a taxi","Attach the report","Book a flight"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Attach the report Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Did she rewrite the message?","options":["Yes, she did.","No, she refused.","