k. Stop doing means to end an activity. He stopped checking his phone so he could concentrate."},{"type":"text","prompt":"They managed ___ the problem clearly.","answers":["to explain"],"hint":"t","explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. They managed to explain the problem clearly."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Would you mind ___ this paragraph?","answers":["reading"],"hint":"r","explanation":"An ing form or an infinitive can change the meaning. Remember to do means not to forget a task. Stop doing means to end an activity. Would you mind reading this paragraph?"}]}]',total_questions=36,updated_at=1792281600000 WHERE id='B1-10.2' AND status='draft' AND total_questions=0 AND edition='' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_assignments WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id) AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM navigate_progress WHERE unit_id=navigate_units.id);
