oduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose."}],"captions":"/orbit-lessons/B1-11-3-643967768a64.vtt"},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"vocabulary","title":"Word builder","instructions":"Task 1 · Вспомни слово по переводу. Первая буква дана как подсказка.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «утверждение».","answers":["claim"],"hint":"c","explanation":"claim — утверждение."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «контраргумент».","answers":["counterargument"],"hint":"c","explanation":"counterargument — контраргумент."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «взвешенный».","answers":["balanced"],"hint":"b","explanation":"balanced — взвешенный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «убедительный».","answers":["convincing"],"hint":"c","explanation":"convincing — убедительный."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «относящийся к делу».","answers":["relevant"],"hint":"r","explanation":"relevant — относящийся к делу."},{"type":"text","prompt":"Напиши английское слово или выражение: «конкретный».","answers":["specific"],"hint":"s","explanation":"specific — конкретный."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Choose the right form","instructions":"Task 2 · Выбери подходящую форму, чтобы заполнить пропуск.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Staff are needed ___ the library can operate safely.","options":["despite","so that","in order to"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose. Staff are needed so that the library can operate safely."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The trial was successful; ___, they extended it.","options":["therefore","although","despite"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose. The trial was successful; therefore, they extended it."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ extra hours cost money, volunteers can help.","options":["Despite","However of","Although"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose. Although extra hours cost money, volunteers can help."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The plan is useful. ___, it needs more funding.","options":["Despite","However","Although"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose. The plan is useful. However, it needs more funding."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"They will run a trial in order ___ evidence.","options":["to collect","collecting","collect"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose. They will run a trial in order to collect evidence."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ the extra cost, they want to try the idea.","options":["Although","However","Despite"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose. Despite the extra cost, they want to try the idea."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["needed","so","that","the","library","can","operate","safely","Staff","are"],"answers":["Staff are needed so that the library can operate safely."],"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["successful;","therefore,","they","extended","it","The","trial","was"],"answers":["The trial was successful; therefore, they extended it."],"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["money,","volunteers","can","help","Although","extra","hours","cost"],"answers":["Although extra hours cost money, volunteers can help."],"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose."},{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["it","needs","more","funding","The","plan","is","useful.","However,"],"answers":["The plan is useful. However, it needs more funding."],"explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"reading","skill":"reading","title":"Read the story","instructions":"Our library wants to stay open later. Supporters say students need a quiet place after work. However, extra hours would increase staffing costs. Some volunteers have offered to help, although trained staff would still be needed. The committee will run a three-month trial in order to collect evidence before making a permanent decision.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"How long will the trial last?","options":["Three months","Three days","A year"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Three months Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Why run a trial?","options":["To avoid any discussion","To sell the building","To collect evidence"],"answer":2,"explanation":"To collect evidence Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What change does the library want?","options":["To close every weekend","To stay open later","To sell all its books"],"answer":1,"explanation":"To stay open later Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"/orbit-lessons/story-df39093291ae.m4a","type":"listening","skill":"listening","title":"Listen for detail","instructions":"Task 5 · Послушай историю и ответь на вопросы. Запись можно прослушать ещё раз.","transcript":"Our library wants to stay open later. Supporters say students need a quiet place after work. However, extra hours would increase staffing costs. Some volunteers have offered to help, although trained staff would still be needed. The committee will run a three-month trial in order to collect evidence before making a permanent decision.","questions":[{"type":"choice","prompt":"Why do supporters want the change?","options":["Students need a quiet place after work.","Books are too expensive.","The building is too large."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Students need a quiet place after work. Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"What would extra hours increase?","options":["The price of buses","The number of schools","Staffing costs"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Staffing costs Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"Who has offered to help?","options":["No one","Some volunteers","Only tourists"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Some volunteers Ответ находится в истории этого юнита."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Complete the gaps","instructions":"Task 6 · Введи пропущенное слово или выражение.","questions":[{"type":"text","prompt":"Staff are needed ___ the library can operate safely.","answers":["so that"],"hint":"s","explanation":"Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose. Staff are needed so that the library can oper