se","practising","to practise"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use time, context and meaning to decide. Notice completed results, ongoing activities, reported ideas and imagined situations. His teacher suggested practising twice a week."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"If he had more time, he ___ practise daily.","options":["would","will","is"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use time, context and meaning to decide. Notice completed results, ongoing activities, reported ideas and imagined situations. If he had more time, he would practise daily."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"The first recording was ___ in January.","options":["make","making","made"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Use time, context and meaning to decide. Notice completed results, ongoing activities, reported ideas and imagined situations. The first recording was made in January."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"He said he ___ noticed clearer pronunciation.","options":["was","had","has been"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Use time, context and meaning to decide. Notice completed results, ongoing activities, reported ideas and imagined situations. He said he had noticed clearer pronunciation."},{"type":"choice","prompt":"___ the course has ended, he will keep learning.","options":["Although","Despite","However of"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Use time, context and meaning to decide. Notice completed results, ongoing activities, reported ideas and imagined situations. Although the course has ended, he will keep learning."}]},{"mediaUrl":"","type":"practice","skill":"grammar","title":"Put it together","instructions":"Task 3 · Нажимай на слова по порядку и собери предложение.","questions":[{"type":"order","prompt":"Собери правильное предложение.","tokens":["been","keeping","a","speaking","diary","for","a","month","Amir","has"],"answers":["Amir has been keeping a speaking diary for a month."],"explanation":"Use time, context and meaning to decide. Notice completed results, ongoing activities, reported ideas and imagined situations."},{"